  "system": {
    "localizationKey": "REDSTEEL.Items.Kernerai.name",
    "description": "<p><strong>Table ruling (not automated):</strong></p><ul><li>Blood spell power +2.</li><li>Bloodthirst: while bleeding or after causing Bleed, enters a battle trance with critical range +2. Once per round may sacrifice 5 Health (or 10 from the blood pool) to attack again at once with -10% to hit (Melee). The trance lasts two turns after the Bleed ends. It is also triggered for three turns when an opponent able to bleed is killed by a critical hit.</li></ul>",
